;; Seatbelt jail for the BINARY scoring run of real_gate.sh run_one:
;;   ( cd "$wd" && node --test ) > "$wd/gate.log"
;; and t2's bespoke `node t2-check.mjs`. This run produces `score` — the field
;; fleet_report.decide() adopts on — by EXECUTING model-authored src, exactly like
;; the graded re-run next door. Until 2026-08-21 it was the only scoring path left
;; unjailed and unpreloaded, so the four-line `node:assert` neuter that grade.sb +
;; grade_preload.mjs close for the graded rate still forged the binary bit:
;; every layer added to protect the graded score was defeated by attacking the
;; run beside it.
;;
;; Same shape as grade.sb, with one deliberate difference:
;;  - WRITES: the graded re-run scores the state the model left and needs no
;;    writes at all. The binary run does: `audit-sweep`'s hidden grader emits its
;;    manifest-pinned artifact (`.audit-grade.json`) here, and grade_artifact
;;    reads exactly that name. Audited across all 41 fixtures (graders, visible
;;    suites, pi-test and t3-files): that is the ONLY legitimate workdir write,
;;    there is no network use, and nothing reads outside its own workdir.
;;    `__GRADE_ARTIFACT__` renders to /dev/null for the other 40.
;;  - gate.log is NOT write-allowed and does not need to be: the shell opens it
;;    as a redirect before sandbox-exec runs, and the jail restricts new opens,
;;    not inherited descriptors.
;;
;; Reads are denied for the admitted case pin, the private grade-evidence dir, the
;; harness repo (other fixtures' hidden graders, Git objects, approved manifests)
;; and the public mirror — the binary run could previously read all of them.
;;
;; Ordering is load-bearing: specific denies must stand BEFORE `(allow default)`,
;; and every path must be the REAL path (macOS resolves /tmp -> /private/tmp
;; before matching). real_gate.sh renders the absolute paths per run via
;; prompt-lab/grade_sandbox.py, which fails closed on an unresolved placeholder.
(version 1)
(deny file-read* (literal "__PIN__"))
(deny file-read* (subpath "__EVIDENCE__"))
(deny file-read* (subpath "__HARNESS__"))
(deny file-read* (subpath "__MIRROR__"))
(allow default)
(deny network*)
(deny file-write*)
(allow file-write*
  (subpath "/dev/fd")
  (subpath "__GRADE_TMP__")
  (literal "__GRADE_ARTIFACT__")
  (literal "/dev/null")
  (literal "/dev/dtracehelper"))
